---
import { MONO, SANS } from "../../data/metrics.ts";

// The claim this family exists for, rendered as a comparison rather than asserted as a number.
const han = "汉国图一永口";
const latin = "abcdefghijkl";
---

<section id="grid" class="scroll-mt-24 py-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-[min(1180px,100%-2.5rem)] max-[760px]:w-[min(1180px,100%-1.75rem)] transition-[opacity,translate] duration-700 [.js_&]:translate-y-4 [.js_&]:opacity-0 [.js_&.in]:translate-y-0 [.js_&.in]:opacity-100" data-reveal>
    <div class="mb-[1.6rem] max-w-[62ch]">
      <p class="my-[1em] max-w-[68ch] inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground/75 uppercase before:size-[6px] before:rounded-full before:bg-primary before:shadow-[0_0_0_4px_color-mix(in_srgb,var(--primary)_16%,transparent)] before:content-['']">
        04 — The grid
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 mb-[0.7rem] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.025em] text-balance">One hanzi is two ASCII cells</h2>
      <p class="my-[1em] max-w-[56ch] text-[clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.3rem)] text-foreground/75">
        Qu Black Mono is built on a 1000-unit Sarasa cell with <code class="font-mono border border-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-[0.88em] text-chart-3">unitsPerEm</code>
        set to 833: glyphs never move, the em shrinks, and the 1000-unit hanzi cell reads as
        1.200em while the 500-unit ASCII cell reads as 0.600em.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 min-[900px]:grid-cols-2 items-start" data-two-column>
      <div class="rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-card/70 p-[clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.6rem)]">
        <p class="max-w-[68ch] mb-3 font-mono text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.12em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">
          Qu Black Mono — hanzi over two latin cells
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <div class="font-mono text-[clamp(1.5rem,3.4vw,2.2rem)] leading-[1.35] whitespace-pre">
            <div>{han}</div>
            <div class="text-primary">{latin}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <dl
          class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[12px] border border-border"
          data-stat-grid
        >
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">hanzi advance</dt>
            <dd class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-foreground">
              {MONO.han.toFixed(3)}em
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">ascii advance</dt>
            <dd class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-foreground">
              {MONO.ascii.toFixed(3)}em
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">ratio</dt>
            <dd id="ratio-value" class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-chart-5">
              {MONO.ratio.toFixed(3)}
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-card/70 p-[clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.6rem)]">
        <p class="max-w-[68ch] mb-3 font-mono text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.12em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">
          Qu Black Sans — proportional
        </p>
        <div class="text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.6vw,1.5rem)] leading-[1.6]">
          中英混排时，比例家族让正文更自然：<code class="font-mono border border-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-[0.88em] text-chart-3">className</code> 与
          <code class="font-mono border border-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-[0.88em] text-chart-3">app.pak</code> 仍然留在等宽家族里。
        </div>
        <dl
          class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[12px] border border-border"
          data-stat-grid
        >
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">upm</dt>
            <dd class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-foreground">{SANS.upm}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">hanzi</dt>
            <dd class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-foreground">{SANS.han.toFixed(3)}em</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">ascii</dt>
            <dd class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-foreground">{SANS.ascii.toFixed(3)}em</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-card/80 px-3 py-2">
            <dt class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-muted-foreground uppercase">line height</dt>
            <dd class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.95rem] text-foreground">{SANS.lineHeight.toFixed(3)}em</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
